{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wpHc868eip1794356672.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，天文台指今早市區氣溫降至18度左右，由於天朗氣清及風勢較弱，新界部分地區輻射冷卻較為明顯，氣溫降至12度或以下。</p><p></p><p>天文台科學主任陳恩進表示︰「預測今日天氣將會是天晴、乾燥，日間最高氣溫大約25度。預計東北季候風會在明天繼續影響廣東地區，早上天氣清涼，日夜溫差頗大。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-0700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026S4DCC1w0L61794356668.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台預料本周後期氣溫回升，周五及周六最高氣溫為27度，有幾陣驟雨。周日最高氣溫為28度。而另一股東北季候風會在下周中期影響廣東。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:00:19.397809+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":208,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T22:38:45.260115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T00:53:42.787104+00:00","content_hash":"dd3b22c9deb8e3a5869dd5c8211c2e696f2ce9565a1e1f88373e3ddd0f91dd22","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:00:19.397809+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}